Cause: the concrete subagent future reached roughly 298 KB and was captured by value across ServiceWorkAdmission into tauri::async_runtime::spawn, overflowing a Tokio worker stack on macOS. Decision: subagent_spawn_channel is the single allocation authority and only passes SpawnedSubagentTask, a boxed trait object of two machine words, to the shared work registry. The registry stays generic because other services do not share this proven failure mode. Regression: subagent_run_crosses_the_spawn_boundary_as_a_pointer plus the existing cancellation tests.
